@page "/instructions"
<div class="instructions-container">
    <h3>How to Play Diagonal Duel</h3>
    <p>
        You'll see a square full of numbers. Look at the two lines of numbers:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>The <span class="text-primary">blue line</span> goes from the top-left corner to the bottom-right corner</li>
        <li>The <span class="text-success">green line</span> goes from the top-right corner to the bottom-left corner</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Add up the numbers on each line. Then, guess how different those two totals are.
    </p>
    <p>
        <strong>Scoring:</strong><br />
        If you get it exactly right, you earn <strong>2 points</strong><br />
        If you're close (off by 1 or 2), you get <strong>1 point</strong><br />
        If you're too far off, you get <strong>0 points</strong>
    </p>
</div>
